OL,3,GNEWSAMayor reveals plans for driverless
OL,4,Abuses
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrials of driverless buses are to begin
OL,7,Fin Lincolnshire next year, according to
OL,8,Fmayor Dame Andrea Jenkyns.
OL,10,FSpeaking at The Great Lincolnshire
OL,11,FExhibition, Jenkyns said she was keen
OL,12,Fto explore how they could be used in
OL,13,Frural areas where buses are currently a
OL,14,F"last resort".
OL,16,FSelf-driving buses are currently only
OL,17,Flegal in small areas as part of pilot
OL,18,Fschemes and need a safety operator on
OL,19,Fboard.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
